# =====================================================================
# .gitignore for the Paper 2 (FM-vs-radiomics) repository
# =====================================================================
# Goals:
#   1. NEVER push LIDC-IDRI DICOMs or derived imaging artefacts. The
#      raw cohort is ~60 GB and is governed by the TCIA Data Use
#      Agreement — re-distribution from a third-party repository is not
#      permitted. Users must download from TCIA directly.
#   2. NEVER push foundation-model weights (BiomedCLIP, RadImageNet).
#      These have their own licensing and download paths; we cache them
#      locally but don't redistribute.
#   3. NEVER push large intermediate parquets (feature tables, embeddings)
#      that are regenerable by re-running the pipeline. The reproducibility
#      contract is "run the code, get the same numbers" — we don't need
#      the numbers themselves in the repo.
#   4. DO push: code/, overleaf_project/, decisions.log, the small CSVs in
#      results/ that are summary tables (icc_table.csv, downstream_metrics*.csv).
# =====================================================================

# ------- Data: NEVER COMMIT -------
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/perturbations/
data/*.csv
!data/.gitkeep

# ------- Models: NEVER COMMIT -------
models/biomedclip/
models/radimagenet/
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.bin

# ------- Results: commit summary CSVs, skip the large parquets -------
results/*.parquet
results/*.cache
results/*.tmp

# ------- HuggingFace cache (sometimes lives inside the project) -------
.cache/
.huggingface/

# ------- Python / conda -------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ------- LaTeX build artefacts -------
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.synctex.gz
*.dvi
*.lof
*.lot

# ------- OS files -------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ------- IDE files -------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ------- Project-specific working files -------
# Cowork session artefacts
local_*/
sessions/
*.cowork

# Build artefacts from the OSF upload pass
overleaf_project/Paper2_v1.zip

# Decision-process working notes (keep the canonical decisions.log)
PHASE*_RECONCILIATION_*.md
PRE_SUBMISSION_LAYOUT_TODO.md

# Empty placeholder
.placeholder
